# News Intelligence Rules

- News is a context/risk layer, not an unrestricted executor.
- Validate provider payloads and AI output; treat external text as untrusted.
- Use conservative fallback on collector or AI failure.
- Keep weighting, risk reduction, and blocking separately configurable.
- Store timestamps in UTC and mock external news/AI services.
- Never expose browser sessions, credentials, or provider tokens.
